#19018
keeper torch gaunt figure~
the keeper of the Torch~
A gaunt, hooded figure holds a torch aloft against the gloom of the wasteland.
~
The keeper is tall and terribly thin, wrapped in a gray cloak the color
of the mist. Beneath the hood its face is little more than skin
stretched over bone, and its eyes are pale and unblinking. It holds a
torch high in one bony hand, and the flame burns a steady, sickly green
that gives off no warmth at all. Whatever it once was, it has stood at
the edge of this wasteland for a very long time, lighting the way for
those who come through the mirror.
~
